      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb One Bedroom Ground Floor Apartment | Approx. 55 sq. m. | Dual Aspect | Beautiful Woodland Setting\r\n\r\nLeonard Wilson Keenan and Team Scott Winslade are delighted to present to the open market this superb one bedroom, one bathroom ground floor apartment ideally positioned within the highly regarded Park Grange development at Grangerath, Drogheda, Co. Meath.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2006 and extending to an impressive approximately 55 sq. m., this wonderful dual aspect apartment offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and would make an excellent choice for a first-time buyer, downsizer, investor or anyone seeking a well-located home with excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property, you are greeted by a spacious and welcoming hallway which immediately gives a sense of the generous proportions on offer. The exceptionally bright dual aspect living area is a particular highlight, with large windows flooding the room with natural light throughout the day. An ample-sized kitchen is conveniently positioned off the living space, providing a practical and sociable layout for modern apartment living.\r\n\r\nThe generously proportioned bedroom is once again dual aspect in feel, benefiting from large double-glazed windows and excellent natural light. The room also boasts fully integrated wardrobes, providing ample storage and making particularly good use of the available space.\r\n\r\nThe bathroom is finished to a high standard and provides everything required for comfortable modern-day living.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from both gas and electric services and a modern Combi boiler, providing an efficient and convenient heating system.\r\n\r\nExternally, Park Grange is set within a beautiful woodland environment, with No. 53 overlooking a lovely small green area to the side. The setting provides a peaceful atmosphere while remaining exceptionally convenient for everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nThe location is undoubtedly one of this property's greatest assets. Grangerath is adjacent to South Gate Shopping Centre, providing an excellent selection of shops and everyday conveniences right on the doorstep, while numerous bus routes are also within easy reach. The M1 motorway is easily accessible, making commuting to Dublin particularly straightforward, with Dublin Airport less than 40 minutes away. For those who enjoy the coast, a selection of fabulous beaches are also just a five-minute drive from the property.\r\n\r\nThe annual management fee of €892.49 is particularly reasonable and further enhances the appeal of this fantastic apartment.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a bright, spacious and well-maintained one-bedroom apartment in a beautiful setting, with excellent amenities and transport links close by. Early viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the generous proportions, natural light and enviable location on offer.\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\n\r\nOne bedroom, one bathroom ground floor apartment\r\nApprox. 55 sq. m. / 592 sq. ft.\r\nBuilt in 2006\r\nExcellent dual aspect accommodation\r\nBright and spacious living area\r\nAmple-sized kitchen\r\nLarge double-glazed windows\r\nFully integrated bedroom wardrobes\r\nModern bathroom\r\nGas & electric services\r\nModern Combi boiler\r\nBeautiful woodland setting\r\nLovely green area to front\r\nAdjacent to South Gate Shopping Centre\r\nExcellent bus routes nearby\r\nEasy access to M1 motorway\r\nDublin Airport less than 40 minutes away\r\nFabulous beaches approximately 10 minutes' drive\r\nAnnual management fee: €892.49\r\nIdeal first-time buyer, investor or downsizer property\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
